  "summary": "The Japan bond-CDS basis compares a corporate CDS spread with a matched cash bond's credit spread over a stated government or swap benchmark. Under the convention used here, basis = CDS spread minus bond spread. A negative quoted basis can motivate a financed long-bond / bought-protection comparison",
